---
source: crates/tk/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: "p.run(\"promote reconcile --help\")"
---
Attach a confirmed Backend object to an indeterminate Promotion

Usage: tk promote reconcile [OPTIONS] <ID> <BACKEND-KEY>

Arguments:
  <ID>           Display ID or Alias of the Pending Promotion
  <BACKEND-KEY>  Backend-native key or URL of the object to inspect

Options:
      --force  Accept a content mismatch and converge the Backend to current local content
  -h, --help   Print help
